Subject: @maintainer sent you 5,000 sats on GitHub

=== text ===
@maintainer sent you 5,000 sats for the review on acme/widgets#42 (https://github.com/acme/widgets/pull/42).

Nothing has been charged yet. Claim it by 2026-11-25 with a Lightning address, or create a wallet on the claim page.

Claim your sats: https://mergetip.dev/claim/q2V3


--
You get this because someone tipped you on GitHub with MergeTip. MergeTip never holds your money: tips go straight from the sender's wallet to yours.
Unsubscribe (you'll still get GitHub mentions): https://api.mergetip.dev/v1/email/unsubscribe?token=u.abc
